cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this software helps your work, please cite it."
title: "Undecidable-Breakout"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bambini"
    given-names: "Edoardo"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-08-22"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/undecidable-research/undecidable-breakout"
abstract: >-
  A conformance suite that tests whether a sandbox actually holds: it runs a fixed,
  deterministic corpus of documented escape techniques inside a containment
  configuration and reports, per technique, whether it ESCAPED, was CONTAINED, or was
  SKIPPED as not applicable. It never proves a sandbox safe; it proves, reproducibly,
  when it is not.
keywords:
  - security
  - sandbox
  - conformance
  - egress-control
  - container-escape
